      "text": "NEW: DHS tells @FoxNews that new data reveals vehicle rammings/attacks are surging against federal immigration agents, up 1,300% vs ICE compared to 2024 and up 58% vs CBP compared to 2024. \n\nOverall, since January 20, there have been 99 vehicle attacks against federal immigration agents, more than double compared to the 47 attacks faced during the same period last year, per DHS. \n\nThe data:\n\nThere have been 71 vehicular attacks against CBP since January 20, compared to 45 vehicle assaults during the same period in 2024- – a 58% increase. \n\nThere have been 28 vehicular attacks against ICE since January 20, compared to just 2 such incidents in the same period of 2024 – a 1,300% increase. \n\nPhotos from some of the incidents 👇🏻",
